 src/plugin/tool-definition.test.ts | 63 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/plugin/tool-definition.ts      | 16 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 84 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/plugin/tool-definition.test.ts
 create mode 100644 src/plugin/tool-definition.ts

